    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    D = [int(data[idx + i]) for i in range(N)]\n    idx += N\n    L1 = int(data[idx])\n    C1 = int(data[idx + 1])\n    K1 = int(data[idx + 2])\n    idx += 3\n    L2 = int(data[idx])\n    C2 = int(data[idx + 1])\n    K2 = int(data[idx + 2])\n\n    INF = 10**18\n    dp = [[INF] * (K1 + 1) for _ in range(N + 1)]\n    dp[0][0] = 0\n\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        di = D[i - 1]\n        maxk_i = (di + L1 - 1) // L1\n        for a in range(K1 + 1):\n            min_x2 = INF\n            ub = min(a, maxk_i)\n            for k in range(ub + 1):\n                pa = a - k\n                prev = dp[i - 1][pa]\n                if prev == INF:\n                    continue\n                rem = di - k * L1\n                x2k = 0\n                if rem > 0:\n                    x2k = (rem + L2 - 1) // L2\n                tot = prev + x2k\n                if tot < min_x2:\n                    min_x2 = tot\n            dp[i][a] = min_x2\n\n    ans = INF\n    for a in range(K1 + 1):\n        x2need = dp[N][a]\n        if x2need <= K2:\n            cost = a * C1 + x2need * C2\n            if cost < ans:\n                ans = cost\n\n    if ans == INF:\n        print(-1)\n    else:\n        print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
