      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef solve_stdin(stdin):\n    data = stdin.split()\n    idx = 0\n    N1 = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n    N2 = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n    M = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n    N = N1 + N2\n    adj = [[] for _ in range(N + 1)]\n    for _ in range(M):\n        a = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n        b = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n        adj[a].append(b)\n        adj[b].append(a)\n\n    def bfs(start):\n        dist = [-1] * (N + 1)\n        dist[start] = 0\n        q = deque([start])\n        maxd = 0\n        while q:\n            u = q.popleft()\n            for nei in adj[u]:\n                if dist[nei] == -1:\n                    dist[nei] = dist[u] + 1\n                    if dist[nei] > maxd:\n                        maxd = dist[nei]\n                    q.append(nei)\n        return maxd\n\n    maxA = bfs(1)\n    maxB = bfs(N)\n    ans = maxA + 1 + maxB\n    print(ans)\n\nsolve_stdin(sys.stdin.read())\n```",
