    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(input_data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    intervals = []\n    for _ in range(N):\n        T = int(input_data[idx])\n        D = int(input_data[idx + 1])\n        L = T\n        R = T + D\n        intervals.append((R, L))\n        idx += 2\n    intervals.sort(key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1]))\n    last = -1\n    count = 0\n    for R, L in intervals:\n        sched = max(L, last + 1)\n        if sched <= R:\n            last = sched\n            count += 1\n    print(count)\n\nmain()\n```",
