      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef run(stdin):\n    data = stdin.strip().split()\n    H = int(data[0])\n    W = int(data[1])\n    N = int(data[2])\n    grid = [['.' for _ in range(W)] for _ in range(H)]\n    r, c = 0, 0\n    dir_idx = 0\n    dirs = [(-1, 0), (0, 1), (1, 0), (0, -1)]\n    for _ in range(N):\n        if grid[r][c] == '.':\n            grid[r][c] = '#'\n            dir_idx = (dir_idx + 1) % 4\n        else:\n            grid[r][c] = '.'\n            dir_idx = (dir_idx - 1 + 4) % 4\n        dr, dc = dirs[dir_idx]\n        r = (r + dr) % H\n        c = (c + dc) % W\n    for row in grid:\n        print(''.join(row))\n\nrun(sys.stdin.read())\n```",
