      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef productMatrix(grid):\n    MOD = 12345\n    n = len(grid)\n    if n == 0:\n        return []\n    m = len(grid[0])\n    N = n * m\n    flat = [num for row in grid for num in row]\n    prefix = [0] * N\n    prefix[0] = 1\n    for i in range(1, N):\n        prefix[i] = (prefix[i - 1] * (flat[i - 1] % MOD)) % MOD\n    right = [0] * N\n    right[N - 1] = 1\n    for i in range(N - 2, -1, -1):\n        right[i] = (right[i + 1] * (flat[i + 1] % MOD)) % MOD\n    p = [[0] * m for _ in range(n)]\n    for k in range(N):\n        i = k // m\n        j = k % m\n        p[i][j] = (prefix[k] * right[k]) % MOD\n    return p\n```",
