      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef process_stdin():\n    import sys\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    S = data[1]\n    total = N * (N + 1) // 2\n    sum_z = 0\n    prev_z = 1 if S[0] == '0' else 0\n    sum_z += prev_z\n    for j in range(1, N):\n        if S[j] == '0':\n            curr_z = 1\n        else:\n            curr_z = j - prev_z\n        sum_z += curr_z\n        prev_z = curr_z\n    ans = total - sum_z\n    print(ans)\n\nprocess_stdin()\n```",
