      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solution(low, high):\n    count = 0\n    for x in range(low, high + 1):\n        s = str(x)\n        d = len(s)\n        if d % 2 != 0:\n            continue\n        n = d // 2\n        sum1 = sum(int(s[i]) for i in range(n))\n        sum2 = sum(int(s[i]) for i in range(d - n, d))\n        if sum1 == sum2:\n            count += 1\n    return count\n```",
