    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndata = sys.stdin.read().split()\nN = int(data[0])\nA = int(data[1])\nX = int(data[2])\nY = int(data[3])\n\n# Find all reachable states using BFS\nstates = set()\nqueue = deque([N])\nstates.add(N)\n\nwhile queue:\n    cur = queue.popleft()\n    for d in [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, A]:\n        nxt = cur // d\n        if nxt > 0 and nxt not in states:\n            states.add(nxt)\n            queue.append(nxt)\n\n# Memoization dictionary\nmemo = {0: 0.0}\n\n# Process states in increasing order\nfor n in sorted(states):\n    safe = X + memo[n // A]\n    t = 0.0\n    for b in range(2, 7):\n        t += memo[n // b]\n    cand_die = (float(Y) + t / 6.0) * (6.0 / 5.0)\n    memo[n] = min(safe, cand_die)\n\nprint(\"%.15f\" % memo[N])\n```",
