    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    index = 0\n    N = int(data[index]); index += 1\n    D = int(data[index]); index += 1\n    P = int(data[index]); index += 1\n    F = []\n    for i in range(N):\n        F.append(int(data[index])); index += 1\n    total = sum(F)\n    F.sort(reverse=True)\n    prefix = [0] * (N + 1)\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        prefix[i] = prefix[i - 1] + F[i - 1]\n    ans = total\n    max_k = (N + D - 1) // D\n    for k in range(1, max_k + 1):\n        covered = min(N, k * D)\n        cost = k * P + total - prefix[covered]\n        if cost < ans:\n            ans = cost\n    print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
