      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    N = int(input())\n    cr, cc = N // 2, N // 2\n    grid = [['' for _ in range(N)] for _ in range(N)]\n    visited = [[False for _ in range(N)] for _ in range(N)]\n    visited[cr][cc] = True\n    dirs = [(0, 1), (1, 0), (0, -1), (-1, 0)]\n    dir_idx = 0\n    r, c = 0, 0\n    visited[r][c] = True\n    grid[r][c] = '1'\n    num = 2\n    total = N * N - 1\n    while num <= total:\n        while True:\n            dr, dc = dirs[dir_idx]\n            nr = r + dr\n            nc = c + dc\n            if 0 <= nr < N and 0 <= nc < N and not visited[nr][nc]:\n                r = nr\n                c = nc\n                visited[r][c] = True\n                grid[r][c] = str(num)\n                num += 1\n                if num > total:\n                    break\n            else:\n                break\n        if num > total:\n            break\n        dir_idx = (dir_idx + 1) % 4\n    grid[cr][cc] = 'T'\n    for row in grid:\n        print(' '.join(row))\n\nsolve()\n```",
