    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef can_delete_one(longer, shorter):\n    n = len(longer)\n    m = len(shorter)\n    if n != m + 1:\n        return False\n    i = 0\n    j = 0\n    found_diff = False\n    while j < m:\n        if i >= n:\n            return False\n        if longer[i] == shorter[j]:\n            i += 1\n            j += 1\n        else:\n            if found_diff:\n                return False\n            found_diff = True\n            i += 1\n    if found_diff:\n        return i == n\n    else:\n        return i == n - 1\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    Tp = data[idx]\n    idx += 1\n    S_list = data[idx:idx + N]\n    L = len(Tp)\n    res = []\n    for i in range(N):\n        S = S_list[i]\n        M = len(S)\n        if abs(M - L) > 1:\n            continue\n        if M == L:\n            diffs = 0\n            for k in range(L):\n                if S[k] != Tp[k]:\n                    diffs += 1\n                    if diffs > 1:\n                        break\n            if diffs <= 1:\n                res.append(i + 1)\n        elif M == L - 1:\n            if can_delete_one(Tp, S):\n                res.append(i + 1)\n        elif M == L + 1:\n            if can_delete_one(S, Tp):\n                res.append(i + 1)\n    print(len(res))\n    if res:\n        print(' '.join(map(str, res)))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
