      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import Counter\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().splitlines()\n    S = data[0].strip()\n    T = data[1].strip()\n    \n    V = set('atcoder')\n    cs = Counter(S)\n    ct = Counter(T)\n    \n    # Check non-V letters\n    mismatch = False\n    for c in 'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz':\n        if c not in V:\n            if cs[c] != ct[c]:\n                mismatch = True\n                break\n    \n    if mismatch:\n        print(\"No\")\n        return\n    \n    # Number of @ in S\n    at_S = cs['@']\n    \n    # Compute sum max(0, fixed_T[v] - fixed_S[v])\n    diff_sum_max = 0\n    for v in V:\n        fixed_S = cs[v]\n        fixed_T = ct[v]\n        d = fixed_T - fixed_S\n        if d > 0:\n            diff_sum_max += d\n    \n    if diff_sum_max <= at_S:\n        print(\"Yes\")\n    else:\n        print(\"No\")\n\nmain()\n```",
