      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    M = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    L = [int(data[k]) for k in range(idx, idx + N)]\n\n    if N == 0:\n        print(0)\n        return\n\n    maxL = max(L)\n    total = sum(L) + max(0, N - 1)\n\n    def can(W):\n        i = 0\n        lines = 0\n        while i < N:\n            lines += 1\n            if lines > M:\n                return False\n            curr_sum = 0\n            numw = 0\n            j = i\n            while j < N:\n                inc = L[j]\n                if numw > 0:\n                    inc += 1\n                if curr_sum + inc > W:\n                    break\n                curr_sum += inc\n                numw += 1\n                j += 1\n            if numw == 0:\n                return False\n            i = j\n        return True\n\n    low = maxL\n    high = total\n    while low < high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if can(mid):\n            high = mid\n        else:\n            low = mid + 1\n    print(low)\n\nsolve()\n```",
