      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    K = int(data[0])\n    G = int(data[1])\n    M = int(data[2])\n    glass = 0\n    mug = 0\n    for _ in range(K):\n        if glass == G:\n            glass = 0\n        elif mug == 0:\n            mug = M\n        else:\n            pour = min(mug, G - glass)\n            glass += pour\n            mug -= pour\n    print(glass, mug)\n\nmain()\n```",
