      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    N = int(data[0])\n    points = []\n    idx = 1\n    for _ in range(N):\n        x = int(data[idx])\n        y = int(data[idx + 1])\n        points.append((x, y))\n        idx += 2\n    \n    def dist_sq(p1, p2):\n        dx = p1[0] - p2[0]\n        dy = p1[1] - p2[1]\n        return dx * dx + dy * dy\n    \n    for i in range(N):\n        max_d = -1\n        best_id = -1\n        for j in range(N):\n            if j == i:\n                continue\n            d = dist_sq(points[i], points[j])\n            if d > max_d or (d == max_d and (j + 1) < best_id):\n                max_d = d\n                best_id = j + 1\n        print(best_id)\n\nmain()\n```",
