      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    A = int(data[0])\n    B = int(data[1])\n    C = int(data[2])\n    D = int(data[3])\n    left = A\n    right = C - 1\n    if left > right:\n        print(0)\n        return\n\n    def count_in_range(l, r, modd, rem):\n        return (r - rem) // modd - (l - 1 - rem) // modd\n\n    P2 = [3, 3, 1, 1]\n    cum12 = [2, 1, 0, 1]\n    nb = B // 2\n    nd = D // 2\n    ob = B % 2\n    od = D % 2\n    total = 0\n    for r in range(4):\n        num = count_in_range(left, right, 4, r)\n        if num == 0:\n            continue\n        p2 = P2[r]\n        c1 = cum12[r]\n        cum_ob = c1 if ob == 1 else 0\n        cum_od = c1 if od == 1 else 0\n        if nb == nd:\n            l2 = cum_od - cum_ob\n        else:\n            init2 = p2 - cum_ob\n            fulln = nd - nb - 1\n            full2 = max(0, fulln) * p2\n            fin2 = cum_od\n            l2 = init2 + full2 + fin2\n        total += num * l2\n    print(total)\n\nsolve()\n```",
