      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    idx = 0\n    N = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    \n    dist = [[0] * N for _ in range(N)]\n    for i in range(N - 1):\n        for k in range(N - 1 - i):\n            d = int(data[idx])\n            j = i + 1 + k\n            dist[i][j] = d\n            dist[j][i] = d\n            idx += 1\n    \n    INF = 10**18\n    dp = [-INF] * (1 << N)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    \n    for i in range(N):\n        for j in range(i + 1, N):\n            w = dist[i][j]\n            maskij = (1 << i) | (1 << j)\n            for s in range(1 << N):\n                if (s & maskij) == 0:\n                    news = s | maskij\n                    dp[news] = max(dp[news], dp[s] + w)\n    \n    ans = max(dp)\n    print(ans)\n\nmain()\n```",
