      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    idx = 1\n    odd_to_w = defaultdict(int)\n    for i in range(N):\n        S = int(data[idx])\n        C = int(data[idx + 1])\n        idx += 2\n        K = 0\n        cur_S = S\n        while cur_S % 2 == 0:\n            cur_S //= 2\n            K += 1\n        O = cur_S\n        w_add = C * (1 << K)\n        odd_to_w[O] += w_add\n    ans = 0\n    for w in odd_to_w.values():\n        ans += bin(w).count('1')\n    print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
