      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef solution(nums: List[int]) -> int:\n    n = len(nums)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1  # empty class, one way: select nothing\n    freq = [0] * (n + 1)\n    for x in nums:\n        freq[x] += 1\n    prefix = [0] * (n + 2)\n    for i in range(1, n + 2):\n        prefix[i] = prefix[i - 1] + freq[i - 1]\n    ans = 0\n    for k in range(n + 1):\n        if freq[k] == 0 and prefix[k] == k:\n            ans += 1\n    return ans\n```",
