      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef finalPositions(nums, moveFrom, moveTo):\n    count = {}\n    for num in nums:\n        count[num] = count.get(num, 0) + 1\n    for i in range(len(moveFrom)):\n        f = moveFrom[i]\n        t = moveTo[i]\n        temp = count.pop(f, 0)\n        if temp > 0:\n            count[t] = count.get(t, 0) + temp\n    return sorted(count.keys())\n```",
