      "generated_answer": "```python\nclass TrieNode:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.children = {}\n\ndef longestCommonPrefix(arr1, arr2):\n    root = TrieNode()\n    for num in arr1:\n        word = str(num)\n        node = root\n        for c in word:\n            if c not in node.children:\n                node.children[c] = TrieNode()\n            node = node.children[c]\n    \n    max_len = 0\n    for num in arr2:\n        word = str(num)\n        node = root\n        length = 0\n        for c in word:\n            if c not in node.children:\n                break\n            node = node.children[c]\n            length += 1\n        max_len = max(max_len, length)\n    \n    return max_len\n```",
