      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main(input_str):\n    data = input_str.split()\n    idx = 0\n    T = data[idx]\n    idx += 1\n    N = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    bags = []\n    for i in range(N):\n        A = int(data[idx])\n        idx += 1\n        bag = []\n        for j in range(A):\n            bag.append(data[idx])\n            idx += 1\n        bags.append(bag)\n    \n    M = len(T)\n    INF = 10**9\n    dp = [[INF] * (M + 1) for _ in range(N + 1)]\n    dp[0][0] = 0\n    \n    for i in range(N):\n        for j in range(M + 1):\n            if dp[i][j] == INF:\n                continue\n            # do nothing\n            dp[i + 1][j] = min(dp[i + 1][j], dp[i][j])\n            # pick one string from bag i\n            for s in bags[i]:\n                L = len(s)\n                if j + L > M:\n                    continue\n                if T[j:j + L] == s:\n                    dp[i + 1][j + L] = min(dp[i + 1][j + L], dp[i][j] + 1)\n    \n    ans = dp[N][M]\n    print(ans if ans < INF else -1)\n\nmain(sys.stdin.read())\n```",
