      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\nsys.setrecursionlimit(10**5 + 10)\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    adj = [[] for _ in range(N + 1)]\n    for _ in range(N - 1):\n        a = int(data[idx])\n        idx += 1\n        b = int(data[idx])\n        idx += 1\n        adj[a].append(b)\n        adj[b].append(a)\n    C = [0] * (N + 1)\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        C[i] = int(data[idx])\n        idx += 1\n    \n    sub_size = [0] * (N + 1)\n    sub_dist = [0] * (N + 1)\n    \n    def dfs1(u, p):\n        sub_size[u] = C[u]\n        sub_dist[u] = 0\n        for v in adj[u]:\n            if v != p:\n                dfs1(v, u)\n                sub_size[u] += sub_size[v]\n                sub_dist[u] += sub_dist[v] + sub_size[v]\n    \n    dfs1(1, 0)\n    \n    total_C = sub_size[1]\n    ans = [float('inf')]\n    \n    def dfs2(u, p, curr_f):\n        ans[0] = min(ans[0], curr_f)\n        for v in adj[u]:\n            if v != p:\n                new_f = curr_f + total_C - 2 * sub_size[v]\n                dfs2(v, u, new_f)\n    \n    init_f = sub_dist[1]\n    dfs2(1, 0, init_f)\n    print(ans[0])\n\nsolve()\n```",
