      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    index = 0\n    N = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    partner = [0] * (2 * N + 1)\n    for _ in range(N):\n        a = int(data[index])\n        b = int(data[index + 1])\n        index += 2\n        partner[a] = b\n        partner[b] = a\n    stack = []\n    intersect = False\n    for i in range(1, 2 * N + 1):\n        p = partner[i]\n        if p < i:\n            if not stack or stack[-1] != p:\n                intersect = True\n                break\n            stack.pop()\n        else:\n            stack.append(i)\n    if intersect:\n        print(\"Yes\")\n    else:\n        print(\"No\")\n\nsolve()\n```",
