    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef punishmentNumber(n: int) -> int:\n    def can_sum(s: str, target: int) -> bool:\n        m = len(s)\n        memo = {}\n        def dfs(pos: int, cur: int) -> bool:\n            if pos == m:\n                return cur == target\n            key = (pos, cur)\n            if key in memo:\n                return memo[key]\n            res = False\n            num = 0\n            for j in range(pos, m):\n                num = num * 10 + int(s[j])\n                new_cur = cur + num\n                if new_cur > target:\n                    break\n                if dfs(j + 1, new_cur):\n                    res = True\n                    break\n            memo[key] = res\n            return res\n        return dfs(0, 0)\n    \n    total = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        sq = i * i\n        s = str(sq)\n        if can_sum(s, i):\n            total += sq\n    return total\n```",
