      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef get_v2(x):\n    if x == 0:\n        return 100\n    v = 0\n    while (x & 1) == 0:\n        x >>= 1\n        v += 1\n    return v\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    L = int(data[0])\n    R = int(data[1])\n    segments = []\n    cur = L\n    while cur < R:\n        rem = R - cur\n        maxk_len = 0\n        if rem > 0:\n            maxk_len = rem.bit_length() - 1\n        v = get_v2(cur)\n        k = min(maxk_len, v)\n        length = 1 << k\n        nxt = cur + length\n        segments.append((cur, nxt))\n        cur = nxt\n    print(len(segments))\n    for l, r in segments:\n        print(l, r)\n\nsolve()\n```",
