      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\nsys.setrecursionlimit(300010)\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    idx = 0\n    N = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n    M = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n    \n    adj = [[] for _ in range(N + 1)]\n    for i in range(2, N + 1):\n        p = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n        adj[p].append(i)\n    \n    maxy = [0] * (N + 1)\n    for _ in range(M):\n        x = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n        y = int(data[idx]); idx += 1\n        maxy[x] = max(maxy[x], y)\n    \n    covered = [False] * (N + 1)\n    \n    def dfs(u, cur_max, dep):\n        myval = dep + maxy[u] if maxy[u] > 0 else -1\n        total_max = max(cur_max, myval)\n        if total_max >= dep:\n            covered[u] = True\n        for v in adj[u]:\n            dfs(v, total_max, dep + 1)\n    \n    dfs(1, -1, 0)\n    \n    ans = sum(1 for i in range(1, N + 1) if covered[i])\n    print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
