      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef distinctDifferenceArray(nums: List[int]) -> List[int]:\n    n = len(nums)\n    left = [0] * n\n    seen = set()\n    for i in range(n):\n        seen.add(nums[i])\n        left[i] = len(seen)\n    \n    right = [0] * n\n    seen = set()\n    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n        seen.add(nums[i])\n        right[i] = len(seen)\n    \n    diff = [0] * n\n    for i in range(n):\n        suffix_count = right[i + 1] if i + 1 < n else 0\n        diff[i] = left[i] - suffix_count\n    \n    return diff\n```",
