      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countBeautifulPairs(nums):\n    from math import gcd\n    n = len(nums)\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        num_i = nums[i]\n        first_i = num_i\n        while first_i >= 10:\n            first_i //= 10\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            last_j = nums[j] % 10\n            if gcd(first_i, last_j) == 1:\n                count += 1\n    return count\n```",
