      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom functools import cmp_to_key\n\ndef main():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    idx = 0\n    N = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    \n    people = []\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        A = int(data[idx])\n        idx += 1\n        B = int(data[idx])\n        idx += 1\n        people.append((i, A, B))\n    \n    def cmp(p1, p2):\n        i, a1, b1 = p1\n        j, a2, b2 = p2\n        t1 = a1 + b1\n        t2 = a2 + b2\n        c1 = a1 * t2\n        c2 = a2 * t1\n        if c1 != c2:\n            return -1 if c1 > c2 else 1\n        return i - j\n    \n    people.sort(key=cmp_to_key(cmp))\n    \n    print(' '.join(str(p[0]) for p in people))\n\nmain()\n```",
