      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().splitlines()\n    idx = 0\n    H, W, K = map(int, data[idx].split())\n    idx += 1\n    grid = data[idx:idx + H]\n    \n    INF = float('inf')\n    min_ops = INF\n    \n    # Horizontal checks\n    for i in range(H):\n        pref_x = [0] * (W + 1)\n        pref_d = [0] * (W + 1)\n        for j in range(W):\n            pref_x[j + 1] = pref_x[j] + (1 if grid[i][j] == 'x' else 0)\n            pref_d[j + 1] = pref_d[j] + (1 if grid[i][j] == '.' else 0)\n        for s in range(W - K + 1):\n            nx = pref_x[s + K] - pref_x[s]\n            if nx == 0:\n                cost = pref_d[s + K] - pref_d[s]\n                if cost < min_ops:\n                    min_ops = cost\n    \n    # Vertical checks\n    for j in range(W):\n        pref_x = [0] * (H + 1)\n        pref_d = [0] * (H + 1)\n        for i in range(H):\n            pref_x[i + 1] = pref_x[i] + (1 if grid[i][j] == 'x' else 0)\n            pref_d[i + 1] = pref_d[i] + (1 if grid[i][j] == '.' else 0)\n        for s in range(H - K + 1):\n            nx = pref_x[s + K] - pref_x[s]\n            if nx == 0:\n                cost = pref_d[s + K] - pref_d[s]\n                if cost < min_ops:\n                    min_ops = cost\n    \n    if min_ops == INF:\n        print(-1)\n    else:\n        print(int(min_ops))\n\nmain()\n```",
