    "prediction": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\nfrom bisect import bisect_left\n\ndef beautifulIndices(s: str, a: str, b: str, k: int) -> List[int]:\n    n = len(s)\n    la = len(a)\n    lb = len(b)\n    A = []\n    for i in range(n - la + 1):\n        if s[i:i + la] == a:\n            A.append(i)\n    B = []\n    for j in range(n - lb + 1):\n        if s[j:j + lb] == b:\n            B.append(j)\n    result = []\n    for i in A:\n        left_idx = bisect_left(B, i - k)\n        if left_idx < len(B) and B[left_idx] <= i + k:\n            result.append(i)\n    return result\n```",
