      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef countMatchingSubarrays(nums: List[int], pattern: List[int]) -> int:\n    n = len(nums)\n    m = len(pattern)\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(n - m):\n        match = True\n        for k in range(m):\n            if pattern[k] == 1:\n                if nums[i + k + 1] <= nums[i + k]:\n                    match = False\n                    break\n            elif pattern[k] == 0:\n                if nums[i + k + 1] != nums[i + k]:\n                    match = False\n                    break\n            else:  # -1\n                if nums[i + k + 1] >= nums[i + k]:\n                    match = False\n                    break\n        if match:\n            count += 1\n    return count\n```",
