      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef minimum_operations(nums, target):\n    if target == 0:\n        return 0\n    count = [0] * 31\n    total = 0\n    for num in nums:\n        if num == 0:\n            continue\n        k = num.bit_length() - 1\n        if k >= 31:\n            k = 30  # cap, though constraints <=2^30\n        count[k] += 1\n        total += (1 << k)\n    if total < target:\n        return -1\n    \n    INF = 10**9 + 7\n    MAX_CARRY = 256\n    MAX_SPLIT = 1024\n    MAX_S_CAP = 2048\n    \n    # Initialize prev_dp for k=31\n    prev_dp = [[INF] * (MAX_SPLIT + 1) for _ in range(MAX_CARRY + 1)]\n    for c in range(MAX_CARRY + 1):\n        val = 0 if c == 0 else INF\n        for msk in range(MAX_SPLIT + 1):\n            prev_dp[c][msk] = val\n    \n    for kk in range(30, -1, -1):\n        tk = 1 if (target & (1 << kk)) != 0 else 0\n        initk = count[kk]\n        \n        # Compute suffix_min\n        suffix_min = [[INF] * (MAX_SPLIT + 2) for _ in range(MAX_CARRY + 1)]\n        for c in range(MAX_CARRY + 1):\n            cur_min = INF\n            for lb in range(MAX_SPLIT, -1, -1):\n                cur_min = min(cur_min, prev_dp[c][lb])\n                suffix_min[c][lb] = cur_min\n        \n        # New curr_dp\n        curr_dp = [[INF] * (MAX_SPLIT + 1) for _ in range(MAX_CARRY + 1)]\n        for c_in in range(MAX_CARRY + 1):\n            for msk in range(MAX_SPLIT + 1):\n                temp_min = INF\n                for cout in range(MAX_CARRY + 1):\n                    s = 2 * cout + tk - c_in\n                    if s < 0 or s > MAX_S_CAP:\n                        continue\n                    needed = s + msk - initk\n                    min_sn = 0 if needed <= 0 else ((needed + 1) // 2)\n                    if min_sn > MAX_SPLIT:\n                        continue\n                    higher_cost = suffix_min[cout][min_sn]\n                    if higher_cost < INF:\n                        temp_min = min(temp_min, msk + higher_cost)\n                curr_dp[c_in][msk] = temp_min\n        \n        prev_dp = curr_dp\n    \n    ans = prev_dp[0][0]\n    return ans if ans < INF else -1\n```\n```",
