      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport bisect\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\ndef count_subarrays(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    next_greater = [n] * n\n    stack = []\n    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n        while stack and nums[stack[-1]] <= nums[i]:\n            stack.pop()\n        if stack:\n            next_greater[i] = stack[-1]\n        stack.append(i)\n    \n    pos = defaultdict(list)\n    for i in range(n):\n        pos[nums[i]].append(i)\n    \n    ans = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        rm = next_greater[i] - 1\n        V = nums[i]\n        posV = pos[V]\n        left = bisect.bisect_left(posV, i)\n        right = bisect.bisect_right(posV, rm)\n        ans += right - left\n    return ans\n```",
