      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solution(s: str, k: int) -> str:\n    n = len(s)\n    orig = [ord(c) - ord('a') for c in s]\n    t = [''] * n\n    rem = k\n    for i in range(n):\n        for x in range(26):\n            d = min(abs(orig[i] - x), 26 - abs(orig[i] - x))\n            if d <= rem:\n                t[i] = chr(ord('a') + x)\n                rem -= d\n                break\n    return ''.join(t)\n```",
