      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    index = 1\n    max1_d = {}\n    max2_d = {}\n    for i in range(N):\n        f = int(data[index])\n        s = int(data[index + 1])\n        index += 2\n        if f not in max1_d:\n            max1_d[f] = s\n            max2_d[f] = -1\n        else:\n            if s > max1_d[f]:\n                max2_d[f] = max1_d[f]\n                max1_d[f] = s\n            elif s > max2_d[f]:\n                max2_d[f] = s\n    same_max = 0\n    tops = []\n    for f in max1_d:\n        m1 = max1_d[f]\n        m2 = max2_d[f]\n        tops.append(m1)\n        if m2 != -1:\n            same_max = max(same_max, m1 + (m2 // 2))\n    global_max1 = -1\n    global_max2 = -1\n    for t in tops:\n        if t > global_max1:\n            global_max2 = global_max1\n            global_max1 = t\n        elif t > global_max2:\n            global_max2 = t\n    different_max = global_max1 + global_max2 if global_max2 != -1 else 0\n    ans = max(same_max, different_max)\n    print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
