      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nfrom typing import List\n\nclass Solution:\n    def minimumSeconds(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:\n        n = len(nums)\n        pos_dict = defaultdict(list)\n        for i in range(n):\n            pos_dict[nums[i]].append(i)\n        ans = float('inf')\n        for pos in pos_dict.values():\n            m = len(pos)\n            max_gap = 0\n            for i in range(m - 1):\n                max_gap = max(max_gap, pos[i + 1] - pos[i] - 1)\n            circ_gap = pos[0] + n - pos[-1] - 1\n            max_gap = max(max_gap, circ_gap)\n            seconds = (max_gap + 1) // 2\n            ans = min(ans, seconds)\n        return ans\n```",
