    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import Counter\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef minimumNumberOfGroups(nums: List[int]) -> int:\n    n = len(nums)\n    counter = Counter(nums)\n    freqs = list(counter.values())\n    \n    def check(g: int) -> bool:\n        if g == 0:\n            return False\n        k = n // g\n        total_low = 0\n        total_high = 0\n        for f in freqs:\n            hi = f // k\n            lo = (f + k) // (k + 1)\n            if lo > hi:\n                return False\n            total_low += lo\n            total_high += hi\n        return total_low <= g <= total_high\n    \n    left, right = 1, n\n    while left < right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if check(mid):\n            right = mid\n        else:\n            left = mid + 1\n    return left\n```",
