      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nimport itertools\n\ndef solve(input_str):\n    lines = input_str.strip().splitlines()\n    N = int(lines[0])\n    R = lines[1].strip()\n    C = lines[2].strip()\n    perms = list(itertools.permutations(range(N)))\n    for pA in perms:\n        for pB in perms:\n            for pC in perms:\n                # Check row distinct columns\n                row_ok = all(len(set([pA[i], pB[i], pC[i]])) == 3 for i in range(N))\n                if not row_ok:\n                    continue\n                # Compute inverses\n                invA = [0] * N\n                invB = [0] * N\n                invC = [0] * N\n                for i in range(N):\n                    invA[pA[i]] = i\n                    invB[pB[i]] = i\n                    invC[pC[i]] = i\n                # Check column distinct rows\n                col_ok = all(len(set([invA[j], invB[j], invC[j]])) == 3 for j in range(N))\n                if not col_ok:\n                    continue\n                # Check row leftmost\n                row_left_ok = True\n                for i in range(N):\n                    cands = sorted([(pA[i], 'A'), (pB[i], 'B'), (pC[i], 'C')])\n                    if cands[0][1] != R[i]:\n                        row_left_ok = False\n                        break\n                if not row_left_ok:\n                    continue\n                # Check column topmost\n                col_top_ok = True\n                for j in range(N):\n                    cands = sorted([(invA[j], 'A'), (invB[j], 'B'), (invC[j], 'C')])\n                    if cands[0][1] != C[j]:\n                        col_top_ok = False\n                        break\n                if col_top_ok:\n                    grid = [['.'] * N for _ in range(N)]\n                    for i in range(N):\n                        grid[i][pA[i]] = 'A'\n                        grid[i][pB[i]] = 'B'\n                        grid[i][pC[i]] = 'C'\n                    print('Yes')\n                    for roww in grid:\n                        print(''.join(roww))\n                    return\n    print('No')\n\nsolve(sys.stdin.read())\n```",
