      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().splitlines()\n    idx = 0\n    M = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    S = [data[idx + i] for i in range(3)]\n    idx += 3\n    assert all(len(s) == M for s in S)\n\n    inf = 10**9\n    ans = inf\n    MAXT = 3 * M + 10\n\n    for d in range(10):\n        D = str(d)\n        R = [set() for _ in range(3)]\n        for i in range(3):\n            for p in range(M):\n                if S[i][p] == D:\n                    R[i].add(p)\n        if not R[0] or not R[1] or not R[2]:\n            continue\n\n        all_times = set()\n        for i in range(3):\n            for r in R[i]:\n                t = r\n                while t <= MAXT:\n                    all_times.add(t)\n                    t += M\n\n        times = sorted(all_times)\n\n        reachable = {0}\n        found_t = -1\n        for t in times:\n            new_reachable = set(reachable)\n            r_mod = t % M\n            for mask in reachable:\n                for i in range(3):\n                    if (mask & (1 << i)) == 0 and r_mod in R[i]:\n                        newmask = mask | (1 << i)\n                        new_reachable.add(newmask)\n            reachable = new_reachable\n            if 7 in reachable:\n                found_t = t\n                break\n\n        if found_t != -1:\n            ans = min(ans, found_t)\n\n    if ans == inf:\n        print(-1)\n    else:\n        print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
