      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import deque\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef minCost(nums: List[int], x: int) -> int:\n    n = len(nums)\n    extended = nums + nums\n    N = len(extended)\n    ans = float('inf')\n    for m in range(n):\n        w = m + 1\n        dq = deque()\n        mins_list = []\n        for i in range(N):\n            while dq and dq[0] < i - w + 1:\n                dq.popleft()\n            while dq and extended[dq[-1]] >= extended[i]:\n                dq.pop()\n            dq.append(i)\n            if i >= w - 1:\n                mins_list.append(extended[dq[0]])\n        total_coll = 0\n        for t in range(n):\n            end_pos = t + n\n            k = end_pos - w + 1\n            total_coll += mins_list[k]\n        total = total_coll + m * x\n        if total < ans:\n            ans = total\n    return int(ans)\n```",
