    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A fetus with the genotype XXY will most likely\n\nOptions: \nA. suffer from sterility as an adult.\nB. suffer from severe allergies.\nC. have an extremely high IQ.\nD. be color blind.\nE. grow into a depressed adult.\nF. be exceptionally good at sports.\nG. not show any physical or mental differences from other individuals.\nH. be born with six fingers on each hand.\nI. develop Alzheimer's disease at a young age.\nJ. result in a miscarriage.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
