    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: It has been found that hours of recreation (r) and wages (W) have a direct effect on productivity (P), so that : P =ar+bW. In two surveys it was found that Survey 1P = 170 : r = 51 : W = 136 Survey 2P = 425 : r = 68 : W = 204 What are the values of a and b ?\n\nOptions: \nA. a = 68, b = 204\nB. a = 2, b = 1.25\nC. a = 0, b = 3\nD. a = 170, b = 425\nE. a = 5, b = 2\nF. a = 4, b = 1.5\nG. a = 3, b = 0.5\nH. a = -20, b = 8.75\nI. a = 51, b = 136\nJ. a = 10, b = 0.85\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
