      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}\n\nCompute p̂_m = 0.20, p̂_w = 0.30; diff = -0.10. SE = sqrt(0.2*0.8/100 + 0.3*0.7/200) ≈ 0.0515, so 95% CI ≈ -0.10 ± 1.96×0.0515 ≈ (-0.201, 0.001), which includes zero. Therefore we cannot conclude a difference in proportions.",
