      "generated_answer": "**G**\n\nMary executed her will on May 15, 1990, and died on August 18, 1990—within 6 months—triggering Florida Statute §732.803, which invalidates the devise to the Salvation Army (a charity). The failed devise passes as intestate property to her sole heir, Joan. No petition is required; the invalidity is automatic.\n\n\\boxed{G}",
