      "generated_answer": "A. Chickenshop's reply constitutes a counteroffer and no contract was formed.\n\nThe reply adds a material term (\"per city scale weight certificate\") specifying a particular method of weight measurement not in the original offer, violating the mirror image rule for acceptance.  \nUnder common law (applicable here despite UCC context for goods, as the variance is treated as non-mirroring), this creates a counteroffer rather than acceptance.  \nNo contract forms until the counteroffer is accepted.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
