    "global index": "MMLUPro_law_1773",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which one of the following schools supports the view that a custom becomes law when it receives the stamp of judicial recognition by courts\n\nOptions: \nA. Critical Legal Studies School\nB. Legal Realism School\nC. Historical School\nD. Natural Law School\nE. Analytical School\nF. Law and Economics School\nG. Sociological School\nH. Normative School\nI. Feminist Jurisprudence School\nJ. Positivist School\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
