      "generated_answer": "**J**\n\nThe statute provides direct public funding for teacher salaries in private schools meeting federal standards, likely including religious schools, violating the Establishment Clause by advancing religion (*Lemon v. Kurtzman*). As a state law, the First Amendment applies via the Fourteenth Amendment's Due Process Clause. Option A omits this key detail, making J the most precise.  \n\\boxed{J}",
