      "generated_answer": "\\[ S_n = n \\binom{2n-2}{n-1}. \\]\n\nThus,\n\\[\n\\frac{S_{2022}}{S_{2021}} = \\frac{2022 \\binom{4042}{2021}}{2021 \\binom{4040}{2020}} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 2022 \\cdot 4041}{2021^2}.\n\\]\n\nFactorizing gives $2021 = 43 \\cdot 47$, $2022 = 2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 337$, $4041 = 3^2 \\cdot 449$, so\n\\[\n\\frac{p}{q} = \\frac{2^2 \\cdot 3^3 \\cdot 337 \\cdot 449}{43^2 \\cdot 47^2},\n\\]\nwhich is in lowest terms, and $p + q \\equiv 804 + 441 = 1245 \\equiv 245 \\pmod{1000}$.\n\n\\boxed{245}",
