    "global index": "MMLUPro_math_7140",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Suppose that $X_1,X_2,...$ are real numbers between 0 and 1 that are chosen independently and uniformly at random. Let $S=\\sum_{{i=1}}^k X_i/2^i$, where $k$ is the least positive integer such that $X_k<X_{{k+1}}$, or $k=\\infty$ if there is no such integer. Find the expected value of S.\n\nOptions: \nA. 0.35462541\nB. 0.32876543\nC. 0.25012345\nD. 0.42365489\nE. 0.50567891\nF. 0.28934765\nG. 0.37654298\nH. 0.46789234\nI. 0.29744254\nJ. 0.41123567\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{I}\n\n## Explanation\n\nThe reasoning begins by expressing S as \\(\\sum_{i=1}^\\infty \\frac{X_i}{2^i} \\mathbf{1}_{A_i}\\), where \\(A_i\\) is the event that \\(k \\geq i\\), meaning \\(X_1 \\geq X_2 \\geq \\dots \\geq X_i\\). For i.i.d. uniform [0,1] random variables, \\(P(A_i) = \\frac{1}{i!}\\), as this is the probability of a specific ordering of i variables.\n\nUnder \\(A_i\\), the joint distribution of \\((X_1, \\dots, X_i)\\) is the same as that of the order statistics \\((U_{(i)}, U_{(i-1)}, \\dots, U_{(1)})\\), where \\(U_{(j)}\\) are the order statistics of i uniforms. Thus, \\(X_i \\mid A_i\\) equals the minimum \\(U_{(1)}\\), which has expectation \\(\\frac{1}{i+1}\\).\n\nTherefore, \\(E[X_i \\mathbf{1}_{A_i}] = E[X_i \\mid A_i] P(A_i) = \\frac{1}{i+1} \\cdot \\frac{1}{i!}\\), and \\(E[S] = \\sum_{i=1}^\\infty \\frac{1}{2^i} \\cdot \\frac{1}{(i+1)!}\\).\n\nThis series sums to \\(\\frac{e^{1/2} - 1 - 1/2}{1/2} = 2\\sqrt{e} - 3 \\approx 0.29744254\\), matching option I.\n\n<explanation_end",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 235,
        "output_tokens": 347,
        "total_tokens": 10304
